{"seq":3,"slug":"dependency-management","title":"依赖管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/foundations/dependency-management","wordCount":960,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"依赖管理\">依赖管理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Monorepo 依赖管理的核心是将依赖分为两类并分别治理，再让它们汇入同一张依赖图。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>依赖类型</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>声明方式</th>\n<th>治理手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内部依赖</td>\n<td>仓库内的其他包</td>\n<td><code>workspace:*</code></td>\n<td>符号链接，修改即时生效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外部依赖</td>\n<td>npm registry</td>\n<td><code>catalog:</code> / <code>overrides</code></td>\n<td>统一版本，避免碎片化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Peer Dependencies</td>\n<td>由消费方提供的依赖</td>\n<td><code>peerDependencies</code></td>\n<td>共享包避免重复实例</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两类依赖的<strong>区别在于是否需要跨包协调</strong>：内部依赖通过符号链接直接指向本地源码，无需发布即可被其他包感知；外部依赖则在多个包之间存在版本一致性诉求，需要 catalog 统一。此外，内部依赖关系构成一张<strong>有向无环图（DAG）</strong>，它决定构建顺序——这是依赖管理与任务编排的连接点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"monorepo-依赖管理的特殊性\">Monorepo 依赖管理的特殊性</h2><p>在 Polyrepo 模式下，每个项目的依赖管理相对简单——安装、锁定、更新。但在 Monorepo 中，依赖关系变得立体化：既有外部依赖（来自 npm registry），也有<strong>内部依赖</strong>（Internal Dependencies，仓库内包之间的引用）。如何协调这两类依赖，是 Monorepo 依赖管理的核心挑战。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 外部依赖&#10;        NPM[npm registry]&#10;        REACT[react]&#10;        LODASH[lodash]&#10;        ZOD[zod]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 内部依赖&#10;        UI[&quot;@myorg/ui&quot;]&#10;        UTILS[&quot;@myorg/utils&quot;]&#10;        CONFIG[&quot;@myorg/config&quot;]&#10;        TYPES[&quot;@myorg/types&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 应用&#10;        WEB[&quot;@myorg/web&quot;]&#10;        ADMIN[&quot;@myorg/admin&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    NPM --&gt; REACT &amp; LODASH &amp; ZOD&#10;    WEB --&gt; UI &amp; UTILS &amp; REACT&#10;    ADMIN --&gt; UI &amp; UTILS &amp; ZOD&#10;    UI --&gt; TYPES &amp; CONFIG&#10;    UTILS --&gt; TYPES\">graph TB\n    subgraph 外部依赖\n        NPM[npm registry]\n        REACT[react]\n        LODASH[lodash]\n        ZOD[zod]\n    end\n    subgraph 内部依赖\n        UI[\"@myorg/ui\"]\n        UTILS[\"@myorg/utils\"]\n        CONFIG[\"@myorg/config\"]\n        TYPES[\"@myorg/types\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 应用\n        WEB[\"@myorg/web\"]\n        ADMIN[\"@myorg/admin\"]\n    end\n\n    NPM --&gt; REACT &amp; LODASH &amp; ZOD\n    WEB --&gt; UI &amp; UTILS &amp; REACT\n    ADMIN --&gt; UI &amp; UTILS &amp; ZOD\n    UI --&gt; TYPES &amp; CONFIG\n    UTILS --&gt; TYPES</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"内部依赖与-workspace-协议\">内部依赖与 workspace 协议</h2><p>内部依赖通过 <code>workspace:</code> 协议声明，包管理器会自动将其解析为仓库内的本地包，而不是从 npm registry 下载：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;@myorg/web&quot;,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;1.0.0&quot;,&#10;  &quot;dependencies&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;@myorg/ui&quot;: &quot;workspace:*&quot;,&#10;    &quot;@myorg/utils&quot;: &quot;workspace:*&quot;,&#10;    &quot;@myorg/types&quot;: &quot;workspace:*&quot;,&#10;    &quot;react&quot;: &quot;^18.3.0&quot;,&#10;    &quot;react-dom&quot;: &quot;^18.3.0&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;devDependencies&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;@myorg/tsconfig&quot;: &quot;workspace:*&quot;,&#10;    &quot;@myorg/eslint-config&quot;: &quot;workspace:*&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myorg/web\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.0.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"dependencies\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"@myorg/ui\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"workspace:*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"@myorg/utils\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"workspace:*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"@myorg/types\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"workspace:*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"react\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^18.3.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"react-dom\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^18.3.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"devDependencies\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"@myorg/tsconfig\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"workspace:*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"@myorg/eslint-config\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"workspace:*\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在安装时，包管理器会在 <code>node_modules</code> 中创建符号链接指向本地包的源码目录。这意味着对内部包的任何修改都会立即反映到依赖方，无需重新安装或发布。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// packages/utils/src/index.ts&#10;export function clamp(value: number, min: number, max: number): number {&#10;  return Math.min(Math.max(value, min), max);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// apps/web/src/hooks/useSlider.ts&#10;import { clamp } from &#39;@myorg/utils&#39;;&#10;&#10;export function useSlider(initial: number) {&#10;  const normalize = (v: number) =&gt; clamp(v, 0, 100);&#10;  return { value: normalize(initial) };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// packages/utils/src/index.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> clamp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">min</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">max</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(value, min), max);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// apps/web/src/hooks/useSlider.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { clamp } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@myorg/utils'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useSlider</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">initial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> normalize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">v</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> clamp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { value: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">normalize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(initial) };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 内部包的修改无需发布即可被其他包感知，这是 Monorepo 开发体验优于 Polyrepo 的关键原因之一。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"外部依赖版本策略\">外部依赖版本策略</h2><p>Monorepo 中的外部依赖面临一个关键决策：不同包是否应该使用同一版本的外部依赖？</p>\n<h3 id=\"统一版本策略\">统一版本策略</h3><p>推荐在根目录的 <code>package.json</code> 中使用 <strong>catalog</strong> 或 <strong>overrides</strong> 来统一关键依赖的版本：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# pnpm-workspace.yaml（pnpm v9+ catalog 功能）&#10;packages:&#10;  - &#39;apps/*&#39;&#10;  - &#39;packages/*&#39;&#10;&#10;catalog:&#10;  react: ^18.3.0&#10;  react-dom: ^18.3.0&#10;  typescript: ^5.7.0&#10;  zod: ^3.24.0&#10;  vitest: ^3.0.0\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># pnpm-workspace.yaml（pnpm v9+ catalog 功能）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">packages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'apps/*'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'packages/*'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">catalog</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  react</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">^18.3.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  react-dom</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">^18.3.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  typescript</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">^5.7.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  zod</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">^3.24.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  vitest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">^3.0.0</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;@myorg/web&quot;,&#10;  &quot;dependencies&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;react&quot;: &quot;catalog:&quot;,&#10;    &quot;react-dom&quot;: &quot;catalog:&quot;,&#10;    &quot;zod&quot;: &quot;catalog:&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myorg/web\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"dependencies\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"react\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"catalog:\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"react-dom\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"catalog:\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"zod\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"catalog:\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"版本冲突处理\">版本冲突处理</h3><p>当不同包需要不同版本的同一依赖时，pnpm 可以通过 <code>overrides</code> 强制统一，或允许版本共存：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;pnpm&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;overrides&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;typescript&quot;: &quot;^5.7.0&quot;,&#10;      &quot;postcss&quot;: &quot;^8.5.0&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;peerDependencyRules&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;allowedVersions&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;react&quot;: &quot;18&quot;&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;ignoreMissing&quot;: [&quot;@babel/core&quot;]&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"pnpm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"overrides\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"typescript\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^5.7.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"postcss\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^8.5.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"peerDependencyRules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"allowedVersions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"react\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"18\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"ignoreMissing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@babel/core\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"peer-dependencies-在共享包中的使用\">Peer Dependencies 在共享包中的使用</h2><p><strong>Peer Dependencies</strong> 在 Monorepo 的共享包中扮演关键角色。当一个共享 UI 库需要使用 React，但不应该自己安装 React（因为应用层已经安装了），就应该将 React 声明为 peer dependency：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;@myorg/ui&quot;,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;1.0.0&quot;,&#10;  &quot;peerDependencies&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;react&quot;: &quot;^18.0.0&quot;,&#10;    &quot;react-dom&quot;: &quot;^18.0.0&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;peerDependenciesMeta&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;react-dom&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;optional&quot;: true&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;devDependencies&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;react&quot;: &quot;^18.3.0&quot;,&#10;    &quot;react-dom&quot;: &quot;^18.3.0&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myorg/ui\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.0.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"peerDependencies\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"react\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^18.0.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"react-dom\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^18.0.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"peerDependenciesMeta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"react-dom\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"optional\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"devDependencies\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"react\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^18.3.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"react-dom\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^18.3.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    APP[&quot;@myorg/web&lt;br/&gt;dependencies: react@18.3&quot;]&#10;    UI[&quot;@myorg/ui&lt;br/&gt;peerDependencies: react@^18.0&quot;]&#10;    RESOLVED[运行时使用同一个 react 实例]&#10;&#10;    APP --&gt;|引用| UI&#10;    APP --&gt;|提供 react| RESOLVED&#10;    UI --&gt;|要求 react| RESOLVED\">flowchart TD\n    APP[\"@myorg/web&lt;br/&gt;dependencies: react@18.3\"]\n    UI[\"@myorg/ui&lt;br/&gt;peerDependencies: react@^18.0\"]\n    RESOLVED[运行时使用同一个 react 实例]\n\n    APP --&gt;|引用| UI\n    APP --&gt;|提供 react| RESOLVED\n    UI --&gt;|要求 react| RESOLVED</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 共享包的 <code>devDependencies</code> 中也应该安装 peer dependencies 的具体版本，确保开发和测试时能正常运行。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"依赖拓扑与构建顺序\">依赖拓扑与构建顺序</h2><p>内部包之间的依赖关系形成一个<strong>有向无环图</strong>（DAG）。构建、测试和发布都必须按照这个拓扑顺序进行：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph BT&#10;    TYPES[&quot;@myorg/types&lt;br/&gt;(无依赖)&quot;]&#10;    CONFIG[&quot;@myorg/config&lt;br/&gt;(无依赖)&quot;]&#10;    UTILS[&quot;@myorg/utils&lt;br/&gt;→ types&quot;]&#10;    UI[&quot;@myorg/ui&lt;br/&gt;→ types, utils, config&quot;]&#10;    WEB[&quot;@myorg/web&lt;br/&gt;→ ui, utils&quot;]&#10;    ADMIN[&quot;@myorg/admin&lt;br/&gt;→ ui, utils&quot;]&#10;&#10;    UTILS --&gt; TYPES&#10;    UI --&gt; TYPES&#10;    UI --&gt; UTILS&#10;    UI --&gt; CONFIG&#10;    WEB --&gt; UI&#10;    WEB --&gt; UTILS&#10;    ADMIN --&gt; UI&#10;    ADMIN --&gt; UTILS\">graph BT\n    TYPES[\"@myorg/types&lt;br/&gt;(无依赖)\"]\n    CONFIG[\"@myorg/config&lt;br/&gt;(无依赖)\"]\n    UTILS[\"@myorg/utils&lt;br/&gt;→ types\"]\n    UI[\"@myorg/ui&lt;br/&gt;→ types, utils, config\"]\n    WEB[\"@myorg/web&lt;br/&gt;→ ui, utils\"]\n    ADMIN[\"@myorg/admin&lt;br/&gt;→ ui, utils\"]\n\n    UTILS --&gt; TYPES\n    UI --&gt; TYPES\n    UI --&gt; UTILS\n    UI --&gt; CONFIG\n    WEB --&gt; UI\n    WEB --&gt; UTILS\n    ADMIN --&gt; UI\n    ADMIN --&gt; UTILS</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// turbo.json - 基于依赖图的任务编排&#10;{&#10;  &quot;tasks&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;build&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;],&#10;      &quot;outputs&quot;: [&quot;dist/**&quot;]&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;typecheck&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;]&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// turbo.json - 基于依赖图的任务编排</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"tasks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"outputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dist/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"typecheck\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>&quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;]</code> 中的 <code>^</code> 表示&quot;先构建当前包的所有依赖包&quot;。Turborepo 会自动根据 DAG 确定正确的构建顺序。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"依赖审计与安全\">依赖审计与安全</h2><p>Monorepo 的统一依赖管理也简化了安全审计：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;scripts&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;audit&quot;: &quot;pnpm audit --prod&quot;,&#10;    &quot;audit:fix&quot;: &quot;pnpm audit --fix&quot;,&#10;    &quot;deps:check&quot;: &quot;pnpm outdated -r&quot;,&#10;    &quot;deps:update&quot;: &quot;pnpm update -r --latest&quot;,&#10;    &quot;deps:dedupe&quot;: &quot;pnpm dedupe&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scripts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"audit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pnpm audit --prod\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"audit:fix\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pnpm audit --fix\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"deps:check\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pnpm outdated -r\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"deps:update\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pnpm update -r --latest\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"deps:dedupe\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pnpm dedupe\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>命令</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>使用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>pnpm audit</code></td>\n<td>扫描已知漏洞</td>\n<td>CI 流水线中定期执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>pnpm outdated -r</code></td>\n<td>检查所有包的过期依赖</td>\n<td>定期维护</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>pnpm dedupe</code></td>\n<td>去除重复依赖</td>\n<td>lockfile 膨胀时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>pnpm why &lt;pkg&gt;</code></td>\n<td>查看依赖引入原因</td>\n<td>排查冗余依赖</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((依赖管理))&#10;    内部依赖&#10;      workspace 协议&#10;      符号链接&#10;      即时生效&#10;    外部依赖&#10;      统一版本策略&#10;      catalog 功能&#10;      overrides 强制&#10;    Peer Dependencies&#10;      共享包必备&#10;      避免重复实例&#10;      devDependencies 配合&#10;    依赖拓扑&#10;      有向无环图&#10;      拓扑排序构建&#10;      ^build 语义\">mindmap\n  root((依赖管理))\n    内部依赖\n      workspace 协议\n      符号链接\n      即时生效\n    外部依赖\n      统一版本策略\n      catalog 功能\n      overrides 强制\n    Peer Dependencies\n      共享包必备\n      避免重复实例\n      devDependencies 配合\n    依赖拓扑\n      有向无环图\n      拓扑排序构建\n      ^build 语义</pre><ul>\n<li>Monorepo 中的依赖分为内部依赖（workspace 包间引用）和外部依赖（npm registry），管理策略各不相同</li>\n<li><code>workspace:*</code> 协议实现内部包的本地链接，修改即时生效，无需发布</li>\n<li>外部依赖推荐使用 pnpm catalog 或 overrides 统一版本，避免版本碎片化</li>\n<li>共享包应将框架类依赖声明为 peer dependencies，确保运行时使用同一实例</li>\n<li>内部依赖形成的 DAG 决定了构建顺序，Turborepo 通过 <code>^</code> 前缀自动处理拓扑排序</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"依赖管理","id":"依赖管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Monorepo 依赖管理的特殊性","id":"monorepo-依赖管理的特殊性"},{"level":2,"text":"内部依赖与 workspace 协议","id":"内部依赖与-workspace-协议"},{"level":2,"text":"外部依赖版本策略","id":"外部依赖版本策略"},{"level":3,"text":"统一版本策略","id":"统一版本策略"},{"level":3,"text":"版本冲突处理","id":"版本冲突处理"},{"level":2,"text":"Peer Dependencies 在共享包中的使用","id":"peer-dependencies-在共享包中的使用"},{"level":2,"text":"依赖拓扑与构建顺序","id":"依赖拓扑与构建顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"依赖审计与安全","id":"依赖审计与安全"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Workspace 协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/foundations/workspace-protocols"},"next":{"title":"项目结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/foundations/project-structure"}}